  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You might have fought for fairer ore distribution for the Metalmaker's
    Union, higher chef's pay in the Provisioners' Union, or better mercenary contracts
    for the Union of Axe and Coin. Whatever the case, you have experience in the
    high-stakes world of the negotiating table, experience that translates surprisingly
    well to adventuring. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence
    or Charisma , the other is a free boost. You're trained in the Diplomacy skill
    and the Legal Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Contract
    Negotiator] skill feat.
